00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:14,000
Search for the Jewel of Polaris: Mysterious Museum is a
fantasy, family film directed by David Schmoeller.

3
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:18,000
While visiting a museum, two siblings Ben and Kim a fierce electrical storm creates
a passage between the real world and worlds within the paintings.

4
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:22,000
They are magically whisked through time to the 1600's and find they must square off against a
wicked magician and also locate a valuable jewel in order to return to the present day.

